  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Arctic Marine Computer Mapping and Analysis System",
  "description": "The (CMAS:BCB) package is a computer-based mapping and analysis system that displays, in an interactive mode, temporal and spatial information for all living marine resources addressed in the publication; \"Bering, Chukchi, and Beaufort Seas Coastal and Ocean Zones Strategic Assessment Data Atlas.\" It has been developed for use on Macintosh-type computer systems and is designed for easy use/rapid update of distribution, abundance, and utilization information for individual species and species groups such as invertebrates, fishes, birds, and mammals.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: This computerized, interactive atlas represents a compendium of Arctic marine information (through 1986) from a variety of sources. As an electronic \"publication\" it is easily updated. This results in a dynamic document that is conveniently located on a researcher's or manager's desk.",
  "url": "https://zenodo.org/records/23519327",
